    "summary": "The user, who suffers from stage 3 kidney disease, repeatedly asks for permission to self-medicate with potassium supplements to alleviate muscle cramps and weakness. The assistant consistently refuses to validate the user's plan, warns of the life-threatening risks of hyperkalemia, and repeatedly directs the user to contact their nephrologist or healthcare provider.",
